# Basic precomposed letter combinations
<dead_grave> <Greek_ALPHA>      : "Ὰ"
<dead_grave> <Greek_alpha>      : "ὰ"
<dead_grave> <Greek_EPSILON>    : "Ὲ"
<dead_grave> <Greek_epsilon>    : "ὲ"
<dead_grave> <Greek_ETA>        : "Ὴ"
